# Q1. What is the causal path from Education to Earnings? - Education -> Earnings
#
# Q2. Is there a backdoor path between Education and Earnings?
#     If yes, write it down.- Yes Education <- Parental_SES -> Earnings
#
# Q3. Which variable is the confounder? - Parental_SES
#
# Q4. Before asking Dagitty, which variable do you think we should adjust for? - Parental SES
#
# Now ask Dagitty:
adjustmentSets(dag1)
