# QUESTIONS
#
# Q6. What role does Occupation play in this DAG? - The mediator between Exposure and Outcome
#
# Q7. We want the TOTAL effect of Education on Earnings.
#     Should we adjust for Occupation? Why or why not? - No because occupation mediates some of the effect from earning controlling for it would block the full effect
#
# Q8. Ask Dagitty for a sufficient adjustment set.
adjustmentSets(dag2)
